WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.040
Listen, here's something you'll want to know.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.790
It exists. A way back to Japan.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.380
Long ago, we Four Major Human Errors
tried to destroy the world,

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.130
but only for one reason.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.080
Because we wanted to return to our home world.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.080
There really is a way to get back, you know.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.460
I don't care about that!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.830
Here in this world, I have Menou!

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.080
I don't want to go home at all! Ever!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.540
Maa, maa. How lovely.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.250
I almost wish I could watch that
friendship on the big screen.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:43.210
I think that line does a good enough
job as trailer material.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.170
Bye now!

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:57.880
I prefer to go home without watching the credits,
so feel free to do what you want.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.960
I-I think it's bad manners not to stay
seated until the lights come up!

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.330
Ah, yes. Of course.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.750
Being able to have this kind of
conversation is probably really fun!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.170
What happened to Menou?!

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:31.630
Okay, time to begin one final struggle.

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.040
Ready...

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.330
Action!

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:09.920
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:09.920
<b>The Duo's Journey</b>

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:18.540
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:18.790
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:29.130
It shouldn't be long before the
fog captures Pandemonium.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:32.080
Then if we hold out until then, we win.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.130
Still, that thing is a pain to deal with.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:41.080
But it only has as many lives as the
number of people sacrificed to it!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.380
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.380
<b><i>3:1-Invoke</i></b>

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.380
<b><i>[And the oncoming enemy did</i></b>

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.380
<b><i>hear the toll of the bell.]</i></b>

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.210
If we keep cutting it down, its lives will eventually run out!

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:50.880
Maa!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.710
But before that, your lives might run out first, you know.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.830
If it's a matter of brute strength, I shan't lose!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.080
Maa! What a powerful blow!

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.880
Oh no! The scattered limbs are heading into town!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.040
I guess I walked right into that one.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.040
Your Highness, please go! I'll deal with things here!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.500
I'll take you up on that.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.380
Now it's just you! How awful!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:44.670
It seems like connecting to the
earthen vein recharged your ether a bit.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.920
What a weird body you have.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.670
Not as weird as yours!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.710
Still, I definitely don't have ether to spare.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:55.080
I'm not sure if I can hold her off
until the fog swallows her up.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.040
Menou...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.210
She'll probably yell at me...

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.040
But even so...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.080
I want to protect Menou!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.460
Maa!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.880
Look, everyone!
The nice lady's going to play with you again.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.210
How's that?

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:32.420
The same attack over and over
again will bore the audience, right?

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:42.500
My scripture!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:45.290
You're so strong with that thing.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.460
I want to see you be more desperate!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.580
Now what are you going to do, Miss?!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.210
That expression! That's right, that's what I want!

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.000
Try harder!

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:16.960
Don't give up!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.330
Or you'll get ripped to shreds!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.540
Maa?!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.670
That's...

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.130
Use it!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.670
Miss Priestess!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.420
You owe me one!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.080
Princess Ashuna!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.290
All I need is this fist of mine!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.210
I thank you for letting me use this, Your Highness!

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.000
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.170
<b><i>[Flameburst]</i></b>

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.630
This drains more ether than I thought...

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.000
Maa, maa.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.500
I don't think you're suited for that weapon, Miss.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.250
I won't last much longer!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.880
Is that it, Miss?

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:47.040
I thought you might entertain me a bit more,

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.500
but you were more ordinary than I thought.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.540
This ends with you dead!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.750
Is that it, Miss?

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.960
I thought you might entertain me a bit more,

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.540
but you were more...

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:23.290
Maa, and I told her not to come. How nasty of her!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.580
Menou!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:31.920
Akari!

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.630
Please, Menou! Use me!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.500
Maa, you think you're the heroine?!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.170
You won't get away!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.750
Maa.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.000
I guess I don't have much time left.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.170
Why did you come?!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.750
Because...

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.710
...I don't want to let you die, Menou.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.380
That's why...

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:07.540
I want you to use my ether!

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:19.040
Okay.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.330
Your power... let me use it!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.460
Yes!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.000
Promise me you won't lose!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.250
Of course not!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:32.170
After all, I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.670
Maa, what a beautiful friendship.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:44.920
But no. What I want is a horribly dark ending!

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.250
That was easier than I thought.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.330
Ma-?!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.420
That's the one that swallowed the dagger earlier!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.250
Akari, here we go.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.130
Okay.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:22.420
Menou, I'll give you everything I've got!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.210
Maa...

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.710
I'm happy I got to connect with Menou,

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.210
but maybe it was a mistake
for this version of me to come.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.670
Good luck explaining this one, other me.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.290
Akari.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.540
You did great.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.250
Maa...

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.750
Pandemonium.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:36.460
You're already out of the lives sacrificed for you.
Isn't that right?

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:41.960
And you can't sacrifice your own body
to resurrect yourself anymore, either.

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.210
That's right.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:47.380
I separated more than half of my flesh from the real me.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:51.580
I went for giant size over invulnerability.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.880
To have fun doing this movie.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.380
What are you really after?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.080
Do you want revenge on the world for imprisoning you?

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.500
Maa, how completely wrong.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:05.630
I was just enjoying the process. I have no objective.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:10.210
I thought Human Errors are supposed to
have lost all memories and personalities.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:13.830
How could you think messing up the world is "fun"?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.630
That's because I'm Chaos.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:21.460
I exist in this world to kill and to bring
chaos in accordance with this planet.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.210
In the name of the Pure Concept attached to this body,

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.580
I interfere with all that is good.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.080
So, Miss...

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.920
I'll tell you something you want to know.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.290
The sword of certain destruction once wielded by Ivory,

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.750
the Sword of Salt...

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:40.750
That has the power to destroy any Pure Concept.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.380
Even that girl who governs Time.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.630
Are you happy? Or not so much?

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:50.170
Doesn't it make your heart uneasy?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.920
That's right.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:56.880
After all, my Chaos seeps in and poisons your very soul.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.170
This time it's actually over, eh?

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:09.630
Very impressive. To think you destroyed that thing.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:12.830
No, it was all thanks to Your Highness's sword.

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.580
But that was merely a pinky finger.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:19.210
True. And there are usually two pinky fingers in all.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.710
I very much doubt this is the end.

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:27.380
By the way, that girl is an otherworlder, isn't she?

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:28.790
I remember seeing her.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:35.380
Perhaps she's the reason why Pandemonium
managed to escape the fog?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:39.210
I would very much like to talk to her...
about all kinds of things.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.540
But I'm rather exhausted at the moment.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.630
I'll turn a blind eye, just for today.

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.080
Give my regards to Momo.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.210
...I'm alive?

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.500
Good morning! I'm so glad you're awake!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:24.040
Am I... in hell?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:28.500
No, no. It's the real world. How do you feel?

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.750
Just awful.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:35.630
I feel like someone twisted a dagger into my head,

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.960
followed by my body exploding from inside.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.460
What is this?

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.170
I see!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:48.830
Then the people I used as material must
have died some pretty horrible deaths.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.210
"Material"?

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:53.380
Then did you bring me back to life?

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:54.460
Yup!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:58.920
I used the dead bodies buried here
to reconstruct some missing parts.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.580
One of the bodies belonged to an otherworlder,

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.380
and that made for great magecraft material.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:07.670
Oh... I see...

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:11.080
Why would she help me...?

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:17.750
Manon, you actually have an older sister, you know.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:22.710
A bright, active girl who's full of energy...

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.670
She loved singing and dancing.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:31.460
But more than anything, she loved movies.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:41.130
Even when the memories fade
and your personality is gone,

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.330
perhaps something remains intact.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.420
What's this about?

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.670
Oh, just something that ended ages ago.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:52.250
First a thousand, then ten years ago.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:16:00.500
Hey, I'm thinking of doing a movie on a larger scale next!

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:03.210
You'll help me, won't you?

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.710
Sure.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.580
Let's bring even more chaos into this world...

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.500
...you and me, together.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:21.250
I'm impressed, Momo.
Pastor Sicilia was amazed how quickly you recovered.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:25.080
It's all thanks to you worrying about me, Menou.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:29.500
Your love is the best medicine I could ever get!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.460
Right, right. I do hope that's true.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.500
Momo?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:44.750
Um, Menou. I'm so sorry.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:48.580
You had a horrible time all because I messed up...

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.710
I'm the one to blame.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:56.330
I relied on you too much when I didn't
have enough information on the enemy.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.790
That's not true! I-!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.580
Don't get too excited.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.000
You're still recovering.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.210
R-right...

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:13.960
So was it the Sword of Salt...
that the Human Error suggested?

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:14.920
Yes.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.500
Apparently it can destroy any Pure Concept.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.670
Do you think that's reliable?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:21.830
I don't know.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:26.130
But it didn't sound like a lie.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:30.670
Isn't the Sword of Salt near the Sanctuary,
in the far west?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.710
On the continent of salt.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:36.380
I went there once with the Master, a long time ago.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:42.000
I'm going to go there again.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.330
I'll use the Sword of Salt to kill Akari.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:50.500
So that she doesn't become an
atrocity the way Pandemonium did...

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:57.500
Momo, will you come along like you've been doing,
without revealing yourself to Akari?

00:17:59.040 --> 00:17:59.790
Yes.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.830
Of course I can do that...

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.420
Thank you so much.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:09.420
Not only for tending to Momo,
but for the compensation as well.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.670
It's fine.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:14.790
I hate to think how much more damage
there might have been without you.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:19.040
Though it's still more than I would prefer to handle.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:24.630
I'm sure you'll bring peace back to
the city in no time, Pastor Sicilia.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.170
Are you trying to make up for what your Master said?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.960
Not at all. I truly mean it.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.000
Well then, if you'll excuse me...

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.920
Ms. Menou.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:42.210
One last thing. This may be unnecessary...

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.420
But you're different from Flare.

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:53.750
You should follow your own path,
no matter what kind of path it may be.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:03.290
If, hypothetically,
I could guarantee that Akari would never kill anyone,

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:08.000
harm anything,
or let her Pure Concept go out of control...

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.750
What would I do then?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.540
I'm back.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.290
Menou!

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:23.790
Akari?

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.880
What's the matter?

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:30.130
Because... I woke up and you were gone,

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:32.540
and I thought you might have left me behind...

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.080
Of course not!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:39.500
I just went to the church to talk with Pastor Sicilia.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.500
Akari, are you asleep?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.130
No.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.790
I just want to confirm something.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.880
You really don't remember anything?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:01.250
From halfway through the evening ball to
when you woke up after the battle?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.380
Th-that's right.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.710
I really have no idea.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:08.040
I see.

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:13.420
Both when I rescued her and when
she came during the battle,

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.170
Akari was clearly conscious.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:20.460
But it doesn't look like she's lying.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:24.830
I don't think Akari's the type who's
good at hiding things, either.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:25.960
Menou.

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:31.250
I don't remember, but I worried you, didn't I?

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:35.500
I won't ever do that again. I'm really sorry.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.880
So please, don't hate me.

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:46.460
You're so silly.
I wouldn't hate you for something like that.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:49.880
After all, you're my-

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.790
"You're my" what?

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.830
Hey, what were you going to say?

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:58.960
Hey! Come on!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:01.750
This is your one chance to say it! Right now!

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:05.460
Come on! Come on! Come on!
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.250
Uh... my source of stress on the journey...?

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.670
MENOU!!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.500
You can't, Menou.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.710
The Menou I love,

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.830
the one who's a valiant Executioner,
can't do that.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:28.960
If you act for her sake,
I just know those feelings will eat away at you.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:30.710
That's why...

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:36.580
I'll do it instead... and kill her myself.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.420
Once again, we're setting off for the Sanctuary,
huh Menou?

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:51.130
That's right. You'd better be ready for this, Akari.

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.630
It's not going to be an easy journey.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.380
Aye-aye, sir!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.130
I'll be fine as long as we're together, Menou!

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.420
That's right, as long as we're together.

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:04.710
If, hypothetically,

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:10.880
I could guarantee that Akari would never let her
Pure Concept go out of control, I would...

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:15.670
No, that's not for me to think about.

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:18.460
Before Akari loses all of her memories or sense of self,

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:19.830
I swear I'll kill her.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:25.250
After all, I'm a pure, just, and strong villain!

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:28.790
Hey, let's take the first step together again!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.580
Oh, all right. Sure.

00:22:33.170 --> 00:22:34.330
Okay, here we go.

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:36.500
Ready, and...

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.380
Menou, no matter what stands in your way,
make sure you kill me.

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:49.830
And make sure you survive.

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:54.330
I'll do anything to ensure that happens.

