00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:16.250
<b>The Pandemonium</b>

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:21.080
So not only Chaos,
but a portion of Vessel has also escaped...

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.920
<b><i>Etheric World Connect</i></b>

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.920
<b><i>(Conditions: Met) - Scripture,</i></b>

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.920
<b><i>Third Charter-Invoke</i></b>

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.920
<b><i>[Our world is beyond words.]</i></b>

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:27.460
This is the first time even a fragment has
emerged since the Starhusk hatched.

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:31.040
It was worth the insufferable number
of repetitions we've gone through.

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:35.330
Now then, time to get going...

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:39.420
...to kill my apprentice for the zillionth time.
